{
"dur": 117.262,
"shots": [
{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 14.959,
"text": "In the car home, the argument the whole game is built on. Lucia's old cellmate Cat got out and, minutes later, was on a yacht popping bottles. I want that, says Lucia. Jason says working for rich people isn't the same as being rich.",
"end": 15.234
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 15.234,
"vo_start": 15.509,
"vo_end": 28.52,
"text": "The bank won't even open them an account, their credit is that bad. All they get is a phone app with a family savings account: money goes in, and can't come out. They start putting money aside for Tommy. Remember that account.",
"end": 28.795
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 28.795,
"vo_start": 29.07,
"vo_end": 43.19,
"text": "At Lucia's welcome party, Cat turns up pregnant, with her Italian boyfriend Mattia from Vice City. Mattia says his boss is a very private person, and brags about what he and Cat were carrying just before they came.",
"end": 43.465
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 43.465,
"vo_start": 43.74,
"vo_end": 56.69,
"text": "Lucia joins Jason on a run, they nearly die, and her parole officer is waiting with thirty missed calls. Your tag says you were a mile out at sea, he says. I can put in a good word on custody. Or a bad one.",
"end": 56.965
},
{
"i": 5,
"start": 56.965,
"vo_start": 57.24,
"vo_end": 66.6,
"text": "Then Brian takes Jason to a peace meeting with the King Fishers at a slaughterhouse. Brian asks where Donny is. And then he looks at the pig pen. Donny isn't coming.",
"end": 66.875
},
{
"i": 6,
"start": 66.875,
"vo_start": 67.15,
"vo_end": 77.405,
"text": "After the shoot-out, Brian quits: I'm out, I'm retiring. In the same hour Jason asked for bigger work, his only income disappears. And they still need money for a custody lawyer.",
"end": 77.68
},
{
"i": 7,
"start": 77.68,
"vo_start": 77.955,
"vo_end": 91.449,
"text": "So when Mattia offers a job, they take it. A bag he and Cat left in a locker at a visitor centre needs moving. Jason asks the right question: why aren't you doing it yourself? Mattia has no answer.",
"end": 91.724
},
{
"i": 8,
"start": 91.724,
"vo_start": 91.999,
"vo_end": 103.423,
"text": "The locker opens, and so does the trap. You're under arrest. Then a friendly detective called Mendez arrives and asks the sergeant to hand him the bag. The sergeant refuses.",
"end": 103.698
},
{
"i": 9,
"start": 103.698,
"vo_start": 103.973,
"vo_end": 116.312,
"text": "Mendez leaves, but his men stay. And they shoot the sergeant's team, then radio in: officer down, suspect had a weapon. Police killed police for that bag, and pinned it on Jason and Lucia.",
"end": 117.262
}
],
